{"id":"2ad7561edabb2148","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-ground-language.md","title":"有限 PR 函数定义扩张的基础算术语言","display":"df-ground-language — 有限 PR 函数定义扩张的基础算术语言","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-ground-language","aliases":["91-df-ground-language"],"display":"df-ground-language — 有限 PR 函数定义扩张的基础算术语言","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-ground-language"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-ground-language</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ground-language — 有限 PR 函数定义扩张的基础算术语言"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}\\)</span>，等号为逻辑等号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 是此语言中的基础 Peano 算术。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(f_i)_{i&lt;k}\">\\((f_i)_{i&lt;k}\\)</span> 为有限列 PR 函数符号，元数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r_i\">\\(r_i\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G_i(\\vec x,y)\">\\(G_i(\\vec x,y)\\)</span> 为其基础语言图表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\,G_i(\\vec x,y)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\,G_i(\\vec x,y)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}\\)</span> 为经典闭包，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}\">\\(\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}\\)</span> 为下述显式函数定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{PA}\">\\(\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{PA}\\)</span> 为本目录的固定基础语言和定义扩张理论。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{f_i:i&lt;k\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,[f_i(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow G_i(\\vec x,y)]:i&lt;k\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{f_i:i&lt;k\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,[f_i(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow G_i(\\vec x,y)]:i&lt;k\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}),\\qquad\nx&lt;y\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,(x+Sz=y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}),\\qquad\nx&lt;y\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,(x+Sz=y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书固定有限个所需 PR 函数的定义扩张，而不是同时把全部 PR 函数都作为原始符号；等号是唯一原始原子谓词，&lt; 是定义缩写。\n图函数的存在唯一性使每个 PA_ar 模型唯一扩张，因此是定义保守扩张。含函数定义的新语言归纳也可经定义消去为基础公式归纳；这里的 PA 不包含尚未加入的 T 语言归纳。\n闭项求值可由图公式表示，显示为 val 的地方不要求基础语言含自己的求值符号。旧 Assertion 用一段中文直接定义 PA，现给明确公理集。</p>\n<p>来源：§5.1，印刷页 29–31，PDF 页 40–42。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}=\\{0,S,+,\\times,=\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"(f_i)_{i<k}","display":false},{"tex":"r_i","display":false},{"tex":"G_i(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\vdash\\forall\\vec x\\exists!y\\,G_i(\\vec x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_0,\\mathrm{PA}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ground\\text{-}language}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathcal L_0\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\{f_i:i<k\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}\\coloneqq\\{\\forall\\vec x\\forall y\\,[f_i(\\vec x)=y\\leftrightarrow G_i(\\vec x,y)]:i<k\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA}\\coloneqq\\operatorname{Cn}_{\\mathrm{CL}}(\\mathrm{PA}_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\cup\\operatorname{DefAx}_{\\vec f}),\\qquad\nx<y\\coloneqq\\exists z\\,(x+Sz=y).","display":true}],"bytes":1955,"backlinks":[{"id":"84940566355062f6","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1b726801dacf2b8e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"253f996295270684","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{PA}$ 为 [[91-df-ground-language]] 中基础算术及所选定义性扩张。"},{"id":"09791de618b277ba","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal{L}_0$ (基础语言, see [[91-df-ground-language]])"},{"id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_0$、$0$、$S$ 见 [[91-df-ground-language]]；$n\\in\\mathbb N$。"},{"id":"d9178a1638731beb","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"c8e718c83a9cc331","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"ba367ff1b4bb3da3","anchor":"r